  "prefLabel": "Hedc 407.03 Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 407.03 Hearing. Any institution dissatisfied with the commission’s decision may request a hearing within 60 days of the date of the commission’s decision.\n\nSource. #10429, eff 10-5-13 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Hedc 400); ss by #13802, eff 11-2-23",
